<BaseLayout
  title="About — Evidence Desk"
  description="About Evidence Desk: scope, example data, and not medical advice."
>
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Evidence Desk is a search-and-browse UI for the OSMF Shared Evidence Graph —
    conditions, biomarkers, agents, trials, papers, and claims with provenance
    and evidence tiers.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Not medical advice.</strong> Content here is for research exploration
    and transparency. It is not a substitute for professional medical judgment,
    diagnosis, or treatment.
  </p>
  <p>
    Soft launch may use illustrative / example dump data
    (<code>meta.is_example</code>) with a persistent banner until curated claims
    are ready. Product decisions (host, dump source, soft-launch policy) are
    recorded in
    <a href="https://github.com/MattH55/osmf-evidence-desk/blob/main/DECISIONS.md"
      >DECISIONS.md</a
    >.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="/">← Back to home</a>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
